    "body": "The verbose help for sendtoaddress and sendmany paraphrased\nfee_reason and left out \"User Specified Fee\". The strings the RPC\nreturns are the ones in StringForFeeReason.\n\nJoin that map for both help lines, the same way estimate_mode help\nis built from FeeModeMap, so the list cannot drift again.\n\nwallet_basic.py checks that an explicit fee_rate returns\n\"User Specified Fee\" for sendtoaddress and sendmany.\n",
